   "id": "ykwildlife-s56",
   "number": "56",
   "text": "(1) An operating certificate allows the outfitter and a corporation with a permit issued under subsection 38(3), to provide guides to persons for hunting big game animals in the area described in the outfitting concession in respect of which the operating certificate is issued, subject to this Act, the outfitting concession and the operating certificate.\n(2) An operating certificate shall specify the outfitting concession in respect of which it is issued.",
   "part": "Part 2 — Outfitting, Guiding, and Trapping",
