  {
   "id": "ykwildlife-s61",
   "number": "61",
   "text": "The Minister may issue a trapping concession to\n(a) an individual who is a Yukon resident and who meets any other qualifications prescribed by the regulations;\n(b) a partnership of individuals, as an undivided joint interest, providing each of them is qualified under paragraph (a); or\n(c) a group of individuals, in the circumstances prescribed by the regulations.",
