   "number": "62",
   "text": "Subject to subsections 68(1), 70(1), and 71(1), a trapping concession reserves from all persons other than the holder of the trapping concession, the exclusive opportunity, in accordance with this Act, to trap fur bearing animals in the area described in the trapping concession.",
