  {
   "id": "ykwildlife-s66",
   "number": "66",
   "text": "(1) If a person licensed to trap fur bearing animals in a trapping concession area discovers traps within that area, the person may remove them.\n(2) A person who removes traps under subsection (1) shall deliver the traps to a conservation officer as soon as practicable.",
