  {
   "id": "ykwildlife-s69",
   "number": "69",
   "text": "(1) An annual permit may be issued to the holder of a trapping concession or to a qualified person to trap fur bearing animals in a trapping concession area for which no trapping concession is in effect.\n(2) In subsection (1), “qualified person” has the same meaning as in subsection 68(2).",
