   "heading": "Proof of residence",
   "instrument": "Wildlife Act (Yukon)"
  },
  {
   "id": "ykwildlife-s183",
   "number": "183",
   "text": "(1) In a prosecution under this Act, any wildlife found dead in the Yukon shall be presumed, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, to have been killed in the Yukon.\n(2) If a person is in possession of any wildlife within an area established as a wildlife sanctuary, the person shall be deemed, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, to have hunted or trapped wildlife within that area.",
