   "instrument": "Wildlife Act (Yukon)"
  },
  {
   "id": "ykwildlife-s191",
   "number": "191",
   "text": "The Minister, a conservation officer, a wildlife technician or an employee of the Government of the Yukon under the Public Service Act and their agents, representatives and persons acting on their behalf are not liable for anything done or omitted to be done in good faith in the exercise or purported exercise of any duty or power under this Act.",
   "part": "Part 11 — Administration",
